    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To battle or to be promoted, that is the question</h2><br>With horns ringing, smoke in the air, the monsters are pounding the crumbling walls, and all around you are the poor recruits.<br>Should they be armed and rushed off to battle or should they wait to be promoted into more hardened fighters? Make your decision wisely and quickly.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/e20d803dfa4471c8648ab6cb54c691af.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower protection? Magic bombing? Or accumulate wealth?</h2><br>Mysterious crystals and shiny gold coins are also important resources.<br>With their help, you can build a strong line of defense, or cast powerful spells, or make smart investments for long-term returns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/3d9ff8ac8866bc21dffc96a80e022c6a.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A rich variety of random elements</h2><br><br>20+ monsters, 30+ skills, 40+arm of the services, 100+ blessings!<br>Different challenges and different combinations create different experiences for each game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/e2f3d454e5f31ad997b4d28e76aa408f.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><br>Just get into the adrenaline rush of thinking and directing!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To battle or to be promoted, that is the question</h2><br>With horns ringing, smoke in the air, the monsters are pounding the crumbling walls, and all around you are the poor recruits.<br>Should they be armed and rushed off to battle or should they wait to be promoted into more hardened fighters? Make your decision wisely and quickly.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/e20d803dfa4471c8648ab6cb54c691af.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tower protection? Magic bombing? Or accumulate wealth?</h2><br>Mysterious crystals and shiny gold coins are also important resources.<br>With their help, you can build a strong line of defense, or cast powerful spells, or make smart investments for long-term returns.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/3d9ff8ac8866bc21dffc96a80e022c6a.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A rich variety of random elements</h2><br><br>20+ monsters, 30+ skills, 40+arm of the services, 100+ blessings!<br>Different challenges and different combinations create different experiences for each game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330920/extras/e2f3d454e5f31ad997b4d28e76aa408f.avif?t=1705405130\" /></span><br>Just get into the adrenaline rush of thinking and directing!",
